aroff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Chemotherapy</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5.95</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.02</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>CARS recurrence worry model</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Age</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">9.90</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.002</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Education</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">7.65</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Chemotherapy</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.66</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.11</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Mastectomy</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.79</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.38</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t4-fn1"><label/><p>CARS=Concerns About Recurrence Scale; CES-D=Center for Epidemiological Studies Depression Scale; IES=Impact of Events Scale.</p></fn><fn id="t4-fn2"><label/><p>Note: All models adjusted for time of baseline assessment.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>